<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca Jan-July sales down 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca Jan-July sales down 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket group Pryca's gross sales were 321.55 billion pesetas in the seven months to July, down 1.7 percent versus the same period a year ago, the company said on Tuesday. In July alone, sales were 50.9 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585-2160</p>
</text>
